{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:e642a3ff1c5b8013","name":"B-Wing Starfighter","source":{"id":"source:reference-e642a3ff1c5b8013","title":"B-Wing Starfighter","revision":16066,"timestamp":"2024-08-18T00:56:04Z","sha256":"bea0f5af9492c64261b44580193adb572cfee75e56635aa1654d8d5e5daa1063","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=16066","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=B-Wing%20Starfighter&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-e642a3ff1c5b8013","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Rebel Alliance"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Rebel_Alliance","referenceId":"reference:52c543ff6d31425c"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["The New Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_New_Republic","referenceId":"reference:e6046dbb57e5abb0"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Designed by ",{"tag":"a","children":["Admiral Ackbar"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Admiral_Ackbar"},", the B-Wing Starfighter is a mobile weapons platform designed to provide heavy assault support to the Rebel fleet. Possessing a unique design that includes folding S-foils and a cockpit that rotates within its housing in the Starfighter's superstructure, the B-Wing is a difficult craft to master. Heavily armed with a variety of weapons, the B-Wing can deliver a punishing blow to slower targets (particularly ",{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"},"), though it lacks the maneuverability of other contemporary ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},", such as the ",{"tag":"a","children":["X-Wing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/X-Wing"}," or the ",{"tag":"a","children":["A-Wing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/A-Wing"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Capital Ships"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Capital_Ships","referenceId":"reference:a08d2e2cd508d403"}," often find the B-Wing Starfighter to be an extremely dangerous opponent. Particularly fearsome are the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Proton Torpedoes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Proton_Torpedoes","referenceId":"reference:89c41c332c03f2dd"},", which can be brought to bear against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship"}," with devastating results. In fact, a squadron of B-Wing Starfighters was responsible for destroying an ",{"tag":"a","children":["Imperial Star Destroyer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Imperial_Star_Destroyer?action=edit&redlink=1"}," at the Battle of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Endor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Endor"},", a feat that no other fighter type could claim at the battle.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Despite its durability and exceptional armament, the B-Wing Starfighter is still slow, sluggish, and difficult to operate. As a result, most B-Wing attack groups usually have an escort of faster and more maneuverable ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighters"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighters","referenceId":"reference:e127af2636e147fc"},", protecting the B-Wing until it can slip past the first line of enemy defenses and strike at a vulnerable target. Additionally, a character who is not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," Skill takes a -2 penalty on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Pilot","referenceId":"reference:383e2d946278a872"}," checks while piloting a B-Wing Starfighter.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["B-Wings also feature exceptionally modular weapon systems, allowing them to be modified as per the needs of the mission. When swapping out one of the B-Wing's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon Systems"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_Systems"}," for another ",{"tag":"a","children":["Weapon System"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Weapon_System"},", reduce the time taken to make the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starship Modification"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starship_Modification"}," by half.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["B-Wing Starfighter Statistics (CL 10)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Gargantuan ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starfighter"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starfighter"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +3; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 13 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 11), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 24; +6 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"ta